WEBVTT

00:17:29.169 --> 00:17:31.880
Uistinu verujem da možemo.

00:17:32.964 --> 00:17:37.969
Dokle god osvetljavamo
naše slepe mrlje tranzicije

00:17:37.969 --> 00:17:40.305
i koristimo ih kao vodiče

00:17:40.305 --> 00:17:42.933
za prepoznavanje kako istinski sistemske,

00:17:42.974 --> 00:17:44.601
istinski mirne

00:17:44.601 --> 00:17:48.396
i istinski bezbedne
staze rešenja izgledaju

00:17:48.438 --> 00:17:51.233
u razdoblju klimatski
narušenih budućnosti.

00:17:52.025 --> 00:17:53.401
Mnogo vam hvala.

00:17:53.401 --> 00:17:57.280
(Aplauz)